<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LENCO, LENVEST STILL IN TALKS.</title>
<headline>LENCO, LENVEST STILL IN TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lenco Investment Holdings Ltd and Lenco Holdings Ltd said on Friday talks referred to in an announcement on May 20 which could impact on both their share prices, were continuing.</p>
<p>A further announcement was expected to made in early July, they said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution until then.</p>
<p>Market talk has linked Lenco Holdings to a possible takeover of fellow packaging group Malbak Ltd , although directors at Lenco will not comment on the speculation.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
